2.7 Lock-in-Clause
2.7.1 PDI shall be subjected to a lock-in-clause in terms of which the issuing bank shall not be liable to pay interest, if i. the bank's CRAR is below the minimum regulatory requirement prescribed by RBI; or ii. the impact of such payment results in bank's CRAR falling below or remaining below the minimum regulatory requirement prescribed by RBI;
